WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.530
- Our next guest promises me

00:00:01.530 --> 00:00:03.450
that you can make tons of amazing meals

00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:04.950
while also eating clean.

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:06.060
She's a lifestyle pro

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:09.330
and the woman behind the popular
"Eat, Travel, Rock" blog.

00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:11.368
Let's welcome Kelly Rizzo!

00:00:11.368 --> 00:00:13.339
(crowd cheers)

00:00:13.339 --> 00:00:14.259
Have y'all met before, Kit?

00:00:14.259 --> 00:00:15.180
Have y'all met before?

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:17.880
- Well, I knew Bob very well, her husband,

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:19.508
and I'm so glad to finally get to see her.

00:00:19.508 --> 00:00:20.970
- [Kelly] Oh, awesome.

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:22.170
I know, we loved him here at the show.

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:24.660
He actually did our season two premiere.

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:25.493
He opened with us.
- Yes.

00:00:25.493 --> 00:00:26.326
- Yeah, and did a whole skit.

00:00:26.326 --> 00:00:28.110
He was so fun, he was so cool.

00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:29.238
How are you doing right now?

00:00:29.238 --> 00:00:32.100
- First off, I wanted to
say he adored you, Kelly.

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:33.570
He loved being on the show.

00:00:33.570 --> 00:00:34.650
He had so much fun with you.

00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:36.120
So I wanted to start by saying that.

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:37.530
- Was just so fun to have around, man.

00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:38.640
He was so funny. Yeah.

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:39.720
- He was a force of nature,

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:43.049
and I'm doing okay, all things considered.

00:00:43.049 --> 00:00:44.370
It is a journey.

00:00:44.370 --> 00:00:47.430
I've just completely been
focused on gratitude,

00:00:47.430 --> 00:00:50.100
and being grateful for the
time that we had together.

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:50.933
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:50.933 --> 00:00:53.529
- Versus being upset that
we didn't have more time.

00:00:53.529 --> 00:00:56.670
You know, Bob, he lived
a thousand lifetimes

00:00:56.670 --> 00:00:57.940
in his 65 years.

00:00:57.940 --> 00:00:58.773
- [Kit] Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:00:58.773 --> 00:01:00.960
- And he truly changed the world,

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:03.600
and he made it a better
place, and he made an impact.

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:05.806
And that's really all you
can ask for in life, right?

00:01:05.806 --> 00:01:07.710
- What a beautiful way to make
people smile and laugh, yeah.

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:10.469
- Makes me at peace with it, you know?

00:01:10.469 --> 00:01:11.887
- And the cutest thing, everybody says,

00:01:11.887 --> 00:01:13.140
"Oh, are you gonna move on and date?

00:01:13.140 --> 00:01:14.841
She goes, "No, now Bob
wouldn't have liked that."

00:01:14.841 --> 00:01:15.809
(all laugh)

00:01:15.809 --> 00:01:17.550
- He'd want me to be
happy, but not that happy.

00:01:17.550 --> 00:01:18.383
- I love that.

00:01:18.383 --> 00:01:19.320
- [Kelly] Bob Saget's still there

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:20.370
going, "Nope, not yet."

00:01:20.370 --> 00:01:21.570
- [Kit] Nope, not today!

